  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Conference Form Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a conference registration form?\", \"a\": \"A conference registration form signs someone up for a multi-day program and records what they bought. Beyond contact details, it holds the pass type and the sessions picked, along with the badge name and payment status. Organizers plan rooms and print badges from those answers.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I make a conference registration form online?\", \"a\": \"Begin with the agenda and the pass prices, then write the questions. Describe both to Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder'>AI form builder</a> in plain English, including room sizes and any group rate. Emergent builds the form and takes payment through the processor you connect.\"}, {\"q\": \"What do conference registration form templates usually include?\", \"a\": \"Most conference registration form templates cover contact details and a pass type with a payment field. Fewer handle session choices per time slot or proof for a discounted pass. Venue and budget decisions come earlier, on an event planning form.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can I build a free conference registration form?\", \"a\": \"Yes. Emergent is free to start, and the free tier covers building and publishing the form. There is no cap on how many attendees can register. Paid passes go through whichever payment processor you connect.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are the limits of a conference registration form template?\", \"a\": \"A Word or PDF conference registration form template collects answers and little else. Each returned file has to be copied into a spreadsheet by hand, and nothing in the document stops two people from picking a session that is already full. An online form records each registration the moment it is submitted.\"}, {\"q\": \"When does a paper conference registration form still make sense?\", \"a\": \"Paper suits walk-in sign-ups at the venue desk and offices that want a signed copy before they pay. A fillable PDF lets people type into its fields in a free reader such as Acrobat Reader. Every return is still a separate file, not a row in one table you can sort by session.\"}, {\"q\": \"What does an international conference registration form add?\", \"a\": \"Mostly a visa section. Conferences often issue a letter of invitation once an attendee has registered and paid, and the attendee includes it in a visa application. In the US, the B-1 visitor visa covers attending a professional or business conference. The form also needs a country field and prices in one stated currency.\"}, {\"q\": \"What to include in a conference registration form?\", \"a\": \"Include the fields someone will act on before the doors open. Badge names go to the printer, and a session choice for each time slot sets the headcount per room. Add a photo consent box if a crew films the talks, plus a required tick on the refund policy. A one-day meetup needs less and can run on a plain <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-form-builder/registration-form'>registration form</a>.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can I move a paper conference registration form online?\", \"a\": \"Yes. List the paper form's fields in your prompt and Emergent rebuilds it as an online form, with each answer saved as a row instead of a scan. Registrations already returned on paper can be read into the same table with AI extraction, and unclear fields go to a person.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I find a conference registration form template to start from?\", \"a\": \"Each use case on this page works as one. Open the prompt behind a tab and swap in your own agenda and prices. The form usually sits on an <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder/event-landing-page'>event landing page</a> that carries the speakers and the schedule.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
}